<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb rice exports up 269.3 percent.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb rice exports up 269.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 40,000 tonnes of rice in the first two months of 1997, up 269.3 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China exported 30,000 tonnes of rice in February alone, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China imported 90,000 tonnes of rice in the first two months, up by 39.6 percent compared with the same period last year, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Rice exports in February alone were 20,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
